{"id":"ccbc12:problem:e-p1917","answer":"CLASSICISM","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>每一个小写字母变量的值代表对应的大写字母点所在的可能位置的个数。顺带一提，题中提到的所有图形都必须是非退化的凸多边形，即便没有任何特殊性质。</p>","text":"每一个小写字母变量的值代表对应的大写字母点所在的可能位置的个数。顺带一提，题中提到的所有图形都必须是非退化的凸多边形，即便没有任何特殊性质。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"能简化一下吗","html":"<p>p2=17, p6=5, p7=15, p13=10, p16=28, p23=8.</p>","text":"p2=17, p6=5, p7=15, p13=10, p16=28, p23=8.","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>P1~P23中的每一个点都非唯一确定，但可能性都是有限个，所以可以猜测小写字母代表着对应大写字母代表的点的可能位置个数。</p>\n<p>（注意：题中提到的所有四边形和五边形都必须是凸多边形，即便没有任何特殊性质）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-6acc8a1db74928543d5ea2ec\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-1.png\"/></p>\n<p>p1=6</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-7451901de4641471136be849\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-2.png\"/></p>\n<p>p2=p3=17</p>\n<p>（简洁起见，只标注了所有可能的P2P3的连线）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-76a75aed28045e4020418a04\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-3.png\"/></p>\n<p>p4=10</p>\n<p>（标注了给定能形成至少一个等腰三角形的所有点的轨迹）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-4b6c7e48561a79baf885a1f4\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-4.png\"/></p>\n<p>p5=9</p>\n<p>（同上）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-ffb6824b794378b0efb95f27\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-5.png\"/></p>\n<p>p6=5</p>\n<p>（标注了给定能形成至少一个直角三角形的所有点的轨迹。注意，三角形即便不是直角三角形也不能退化）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-5a64f522a02f58957f9ae12d\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-6.png\"/></p>\n<p>p7=15</p>\n<p>（同上）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-e0b484c9760f65ee9f758212\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-7.png\"/></p>\n<p>p8=2, p9=3, p10=5, p11=6, p12=9, p13=10</p>\n<p>（可能的位置分别用红 / 绿 / 蓝 / 深红+红 / 深绿+绿 / 深蓝+蓝表示）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-a414c7d54e5bfbd1cc6eeb66\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-8.png\"/></p>\n<p>p14=3</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-d30dc1f182b7113ded6465b7\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-9.png\"/></p>\n<p>p15=3</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-0a1f414a50a4c66f99ed721a\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-10.png\"/></p>\n<p>p16=28</p>\n<p>（不同颜色的线对应使四边形为梯形的点的轨迹，观察所有两条不同颜色线的交点。由于四边形必为凸四边形，点必在粗虚线之间的十字架区域内且不在四边形ABCF之内。由于尺寸限制，图中只显示了20个点，图片外右侧和下侧还分别有4个点）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-e193349a020ea796f1008862\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-11.png\"/></p>\n<p>p17=p18=6</p>\n<p>（标注了所有三个可能的五边形）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-d4eee868d17dfb2c79a021e3\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-12.png\"/></p>\n<p>p19=p20=p21=12</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-f06220651b33f2ac7c052744\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-13.png\"/></p>\n<p>p22=4</p>\n<p>（三角形的内心和三个旁心）</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-de044f4498f6993d8bc55eed\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-14.png\"/><img data-asset-id=\"asset-8e644196c6bf3665da3d61be\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-15.png\"/></p>\n<p>p23=8</p>\n<p>（两个点必须在线的同一侧，而且每一条线会产生两个可能的位置，上方给出了线为AB时的两个点）</p>\n<p>代入下方的十个表达式，算出结果后转字母得到答案：<strong>CLASSICISM</strong>。</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><section><span>p6+p14-p10</span></section></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>5+3-5=3</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p13+p1-p22</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>10+6-4=12</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>L</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p1+p22-p5</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>6+4-9=1</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>A</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p16+p23-p2</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>28+8-17=19</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>S</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p4+p7-p18</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>10+15-6=19</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>S</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p17+p11-p9</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>6+6-3=9</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>I</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p21+p23-p3</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>12+8-17=3</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>C</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p14+p5-p15</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>3+9-3=9</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>I</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p16+p1-p7</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>28+6-15=19</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>S</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>p15+p19-p8</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>3+12-2=13</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><span>M</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>","text":"P1~P23中的每一个点都非唯一确定，但可能性都是有限个，所以可以猜测小写字母代表着对应大写字母代表的点的可能位置个数。\n\n（注意：题中提到的所有四边形和五边形都必须是凸多边形，即便没有任何特殊性质）\n\np1=6\n\np2=p3=17\n\n（简洁起见，只标注了所有可能的P2P3的连线）\n\np4=10\n\n（标注了给定能形成至少一个等腰三角形的所有点的轨迹）\n\np5=9\n\n（同上）\n\np6=5\n\n（标注了给定能形成至少一个直角三角形的所有点的轨迹。注意，三角形即便不是直角三角形也不能退化）\n\np7=15\n\n（同上）\n\np8=2, p9=3, p10=5, p11=6, p12=9, p13=10\n\n（可能的位置分别用红 / 绿 / 蓝 / 深红+红 / 深绿+绿 / 深蓝+蓝表示）\n\np14=3\n\np15=3\n\np16=28\n\n（不同颜色的线对应使四边形为梯形的点的轨迹，观察所有两条不同颜色线的交点。由于四边形必为凸四边形，点必在粗虚线之间的十字架区域内且不在四边形ABCF之内。由于尺寸限制，图中只显示了20个点，图片外右侧和下侧还分别有4个点）\n\np17=p18=6\n\n（标注了所有三个可能的五边形）\n\np19=p20=p21=12\n\np22=4\n\n（三角形的内心和三个旁心）\n\np23=8\n\n（两个点必须在线的同一侧，而且每一条线会产生两个可能的位置，上方给出了线为AB时的两个点）\n\n代入下方的十个表达式，算出结果后转字母得到答案：\nCLASSICISM\n。\n\np6+p14-p10\n5+3-5=3\nC\np13+p1-p22\n10+6-4=12\nL\np1+p22-p5\n6+4-9=1\nA\np16+p23-p2\n28+8-17=19\nS\np4+p7-p18\n10+15-6=19\nS\np17+p11-p9\n6+6-3=9\nI\np21+p23-p3\n12+8-17=3\nC\np14+p5-p15\n3+9-3=9\nI\np16+p1-p7\n28+6-15=19\nS\np15+p19-p8\n3+12-2=13\nM","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-0a1f414a50a4c66f99ed721a","asset-4b6c7e48561a79baf885a1f4","asset-5a64f522a02f58957f9ae12d","asset-6acc8a1db74928543d5ea2ec","asset-7451901de4641471136be849","asset-76a75aed28045e4020418a04","asset-8e644196c6bf3665da3d61be","asset-a414c7d54e5bfbd1cc6eeb66","asset-d30dc1f182b7113ded6465b7","asset-d4eee868d17dfb2c79a021e3","asset-de044f4498f6993d8bc55eed","asset-e0b484c9760f65ee9f758212","asset-e193349a020ea796f1008862","asset-f06220651b33f2ac7c052744","asset-ffb6824b794378b0efb95f27"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你得到了一个神秘的数字：13.53</p>","text":"你得到了一个神秘的数字：13.53","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{"javascript":"globalThis.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']]},\n  svg: {fontCache: 'global'}\n};\n(function () {\n  let a = document.getElementById(\"contentHtml\");\n  let b = document.createElement(\"script\");\n  b.id = \"MathJax-script\";\n  b.async = true;\n  b.src = \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\";\n  a.appendChild(b);\n})();"},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-0a1f414a50a4c66f99ed721a","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-10.png","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1917-10.png","mime":"image/png","size":180513,"sha256":"dd305dce28cbcff1be22603d15836fc46cfe78f2a85e1783f92b4483857c4c2b","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]},{"id":"asset-4b6c7e48561a79baf885a1f4","ur